              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sue Burleigh"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Thanks, Dylan! I just enjoyed this delicious soup. I used a couple turns of garlic/sea salt and low-sodium chicken stock. I also boiled it longer than the called-for 15 minutes after adding the chicken stock, as I like mushy carrots. I'll definitely be making this again!"
          },
