              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "julie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good! Only change I made was using fresh onions and vegetable broth instead of chicken. Very good for lunch to supplement a sandwich. Note: I only give 5 stars if the recipe is fabulous, this is very good!",
            "datePublished": "2010-11-07T17:45:51.550Z"
          },
