            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Carolyn Bryant"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My daughter and I really enjoyed this with some warm biscuits after being outside on a cold rainy day. I also prefer things \"rustic\" so I just mashed it by hand and added some extra water. Also used fresh diced onion and garlic. I think I'll double the recipe next time.",
            "datePublished": "2013-11-10T16:00:36.237Z"
